---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { company } from '../content/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  description="How AT NEXORA Technologies collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through this website."
  updated="14 November 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how {company.name} (“AT NEXORA”, “we”, “us”) handles personal information collected through this website. We aim to collect as little as possible and to use it only for the purpose for which you provided it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="information-we-collect">1. Information we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you give us</h3>
  <p>When you submit the project enquiry form, we collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your full name and business email address;</li>
    <li>your company name, if you choose to provide it;</li>
    <li>the service you are interested in and your indicated budget range;</li>
    <li>the project description you write.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you contact us by email, telephone or WhatsApp, we receive the information you choose to share through those channels.</p>
  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <p>
    This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies and does not include third-party tracking scripts. Our hosting provider processes technical data such as IP address, browser type and request time in order to deliver the site and protect it from abuse. When you submit the form, your IP address is used briefly to limit repeated submissions.
  </p>

  <h2 id="how-we-use">2. How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>to respond to your enquiry and communicate with you about a potential project;</li>
    <li>to prepare proposals and, if you become a client, to deliver our services;</li>
    <li>to protect the website against spam and misuse;</li>
    <li>to meet legal obligations that apply to us.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell personal information, and we do not use enquiry details for unrelated marketing.</p>

  <h2 id="legal-bases">3. Why we are permitted to use it</h2>
  <p>
    Where data protection law requires a legal basis, we rely on your consent (given when you submit the form), on steps taken at your request before entering into a contract, and on our legitimate interest in running and securing our business.
  </p>

  <h2 id="sharing">4. Service providers</h2>
  <p>We use a small number of providers to operate this website. They process data on our behalf:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — website hosting, content delivery and security.</li>
    <li><strong>Resend</strong> — delivery of enquiry form messages to our inbox.</li>
    <li><strong>Google (Gmail)</strong> — the mailbox in which we receive and answer enquiries.</li>
    <li><strong>WhatsApp</strong> — only if you choose to contact us through WhatsApp.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These providers may process data in countries other than your own. We may also disclose information where the law requires it.</p>

  <h2 id="retention">5. How long we keep information</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiries are kept for as long as needed to respond and to maintain a record of our correspondence. If an enquiry does not lead to a project, you can ask us to delete it at any time. Client records are kept for the period required by our contractual and legal obligations.
  </p>

  <h2 id="security">6. Security</h2>
  <p>
    The website is served over encrypted connections, form submissions are validated on the server, and access to our mailbox is restricted. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so please avoid sending confidential or sensitive information through the enquiry form.
  </p>

  <h2 id="your-rights">7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>ask what personal information we hold about you and receive a copy;</li>
    <li>ask us to correct or delete it;</li>
    <li>object to or restrict certain uses;</li>
    <li>withdraw consent you have previously given.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To make a request, contact us using the details below. We will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

  <h2 id="children">8. Children</h2>
  <p>This website is intended for businesses and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2 id="changes">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy as our website or services change. The “last updated” date shows when it was last revised.</p>

  <h2 id="contact">10. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy or your information can be sent to <a href={company.emailHref}>{company.email}</a> or by telephone on <a href={company.phoneHref}>{company.phoneDisplay}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
